  objectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e7733f0f582cf1942a5acc9723881ebf, type: 3}
  questDescription: 'Lina the tailor, darling. My scissors must cut velvet and leather
    like air: the sharpest in the whole land, legendary! And they must not chip or
    break after one week, please.'
  requirements:
  - type: 3
    tier: 3
  - type: 1
    tier: 0
  successText: Snip! The velvet falls apart like butter! Darling, you are a genius!
  partialText: Well, they cut. The hem is a bit ragged, but it will do.
  failureText: Now they chew my cloth! My best silk is ruined, ruined!
